{"id":"82761b178bd1bd90","group":"56","path":"56/56-thm-positive-coefficient-polynomial-monotonicity.md","title":"thm-positive-coefficient-polynomial-monotonicity","display":"thm-positive-coefficient-polynomial-monotonicity","type":"theorem","metadata":{"book":"Term Rewriting Systems (Terese, 2003)","book_abbrev":"56","type":"theorem","label":"56-thm-positive-coefficient-polynomial-monotonicity","aliases":["56-thm-positive-coefficient-polynomial-monotonicity"],"display":"thm-positive-coefficient-polynomial-monotonicity","depends_on":["[[56-df-polynomial-interpretation]]"],"source_section":"6.2.10","source_pages":"189","source_ocr_blocks":[210],"source_statement_status":"checked-against-local-djvu-ocr","source_proof_status":"read-and-compared"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"book","html":"Term Rewriting Systems (Terese, 2003)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"56"},{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"label","html":"56-thm-positive-coefficient-polynomial-monotonicity"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>56-thm-positive-coefficient-polynomial-monotonicity</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-positive-coefficient-polynomial-monotonicity"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"1fcf344733aab173\" href=\"?note=1fcf344733aab173\" title=\"56-df-polynomial-interpretation\">56-df-polynomial-interpretation</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_section","html":"6.2.10"},{"key":"source_pages","html":"189"},{"key":"source_ocr_blocks","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>210</span></div>"},{"key":"source_statement_status","html":"checked-against-local-djvu-ocr"},{"key":"source_proof_status","html":"read-and-compared"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p>设 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n,m\\in\\mathbb N\">\\(n,m\\in\\mathbb N\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n&gt;0,m&gt;0\">\\(n&gt;0,m&gt;0\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"a_1,\\ldots,a_m\\in\\mathbb Z_{&gt;0}\">\\(a_1,\\ldots,a_m\\in\\mathbb Z_{&gt;0}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"k\\in\\mathbb N^{[m]\\times[n]}\">\\(k\\in\\mathbb N^{[m]\\times[n]}\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p(\\vec x)=\\sum_{i=1}^m a_i\\prod_{j=1}^n x_j^{k_{ij}}\">\\(p(\\vec x)=\\sum_{i=1}^m a_i\\prod_{j=1}^n x_j^{k_{ij}}\\)</span>，且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\forall j\\in[n]\\;\\exists i\\in[m]\\;(k_{ij}&gt;0)\">\\(\\forall j\\in[n]\\;\\exists i\\in[m]\\;(k_{ij}&gt;0)\\)</span>。令 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A_2=\\{a\\in\\mathbb N\\mid a\\ge2\\}\">\\(A_2=\\{a\\in\\mathbb N\\mid a\\ge2\\}\\)</span>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"p\\in\\mathrm{Poly}_n(\\mathbb Z)\n\\land\\mathrm{PolyClosed}_n(p\\restriction A_2^n)\n\\land\\mathrm{StrictPolyMono}_n(p\\restriction A_2^n).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[p\\in\\mathrm{Poly}_n(\\mathbb Z)\n\\land\\mathrm{PolyClosed}_n(p\\restriction A_2^n)\n\\land\\mathrm{StrictPolyMono}_n(p\\restriction A_2^n).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>Proposition 6.2.10。至少一个非恒定正系数单项式保证输出至少 2；每个变量至少出现在一个正系数单项式中，该单项式对相应参数严格递增，其余项不减，因此和严格递增。已核对原书证明。这是充分条件；不宣称有负系数时不可能严格单调。n=0 的常元必须另检验取值至少 2。</p>\n<p>来源：Terese, <em>Term Rewriting Systems</em>, Cambridge University Press, 2003；6.2.10，印刷页 189。<code>source_ocr_blocks</code> 是本地 DjVu 文本提取块序号，不是已确认的物理扫描页号。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"56-df-polynomial-interpretation","status":"resolved","id":"1fcf344733aab173","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[56-df-polynomial-interpretation]]","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"n,m\\in\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"n>0,m>0","display":false},{"tex":"a_1,\\ldots,a_m\\in\\mathbb Z_{>0}","display":false},{"tex":"k\\in\\mathbb N^{[m]\\times[n]}","display":false},{"tex":"p(\\vec x)=\\sum_{i=1}^m a_i\\prod_{j=1}^n x_j^{k_{ij}}","display":false},{"tex":"\\forall j\\in[n]\\;\\exists i\\in[m]\\;(k_{ij}>0)","display":false},{"tex":"A_2=\\{a\\in\\mathbb N\\mid a\\ge2\\}","display":false},{"tex":"p\\in\\mathrm{Poly}_n(\\mathbb Z)\n\\land\\mathrm{PolyClosed}_n(p\\restriction A_2^n)\n\\land\\mathrm{StrictPolyMono}_n(p\\restriction A_2^n).","display":true}],"bytes":1560,"backlinks":[{"id":"7a89e84aacc9537c","anchor":"ref-230","locations":["正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"[[56-thm-positive-coefficient-polynomial-monotonicity.md]]"}],"outgoing":["1fcf344733aab173"]}